<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL- Read-Rite trading lower.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL- Read-Rite trading lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Read-Rite Corp was trading at 31-3/4 after the bell on Tuesday, down a point from where it had closed, traders said.</p>
<p>Read-Rite shares had closed at 32-3/4, up two points on the day. After the close of regular trading, Applied Magnetics Corp issued a statement reaffirming its commitment to its takeover bid for Read-Rite.</p>
<p>Applied Magnetics closed at 39-7/8, down 3-1/4 for the day. Its price was not moving after the bell.  </p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said session one volume was 133,000, while sessiion two volume was 1,481,500.</p>
